---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Regulatory Disclosures | Alpha Crest">
  <Header />
  <main class="pt-32 pb-24 min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-8">Regulatory Disclosures</h1>
      <div class="prose prose-invert text-slate-300 space-y-6">
        <p class="text-lg">Alpha Crest (Pty) Ltd is not an authorized financial services provider (FSP). Our application is pending with the Financial Services Conduct Authority (FSCA). The fund remains closed pending approval.</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">Regulatory Disclosures</h2>
        <p>In terms of regulatory guidelines, Alpha Crest is providing this information to clarify our regulatory status while our application is processed by the FSCA.</p>
        <p>Please contact us at <a href="mailto:info@alphacrest.finance" class="text-accent hover:underline">info@alphacrest.finance</a> to request our full statutory disclosure documentation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
